// Stars Beneath, Build 6: Lanthorn, the war world under the thirty-ninth star (levels 10-15). All three paths meet
// here. The Republic holds the south, the Empire the north, and the free captains run a truce ground in the west
// where everybody trades and nobody shoots. In the middle is no man's land, and under that is a room.
// The fighting moves: each week the front is somewhere else on Lanthorn (the Wire, Lanthorn City, the Ring Yards,
// the Green). The lie of the land stays the same; the ground, the weather and the wildlife change.
